## M0 — ${SSOT_NAME} bootstrap contract

### Endpoints

| Area | Endpoint | Method | Required | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Auth | `${LOGIN_ENDPOINT}` | `POST` | yes | supports success, wrong credentials, `mfaRequired` future |
| Auth | `${REFRESH_ENDPOINT}` | `POST` | yes | needed to unblock M1 |
| Auth | `${LOGOUT_ENDPOINT}` | `POST` | yes | invalidates session on SSoT |
| Profile | `${ME_ENDPOINT}` | `GET` | yes | returns roles, permissions, scopes, locale |
| Runtime config | `${RUNTIME_CONFIG_ENDPOINT}` | `GET` | yes | non-secret bootstrap config |
| Feature flags | `${FLAGS_EFFECTIVE_ENDPOINT}` | `GET` | yes | may be minimal stub but with stable shape |
| Health | `/healthz` | `GET` | yes | useful for CI / local integration |

### Agreed payload minimums

- `POST ${LOGIN_ENDPOINT}`:
  - request: `{ email, password }`
  - response: `{ accessToken, refreshToken?, mfaRequired?, expiresIn? }`
- `GET ${ME_ENDPOINT}`:
  - response: `{ id, email, displayName, roles[], permissions[], scopes[], locale, mfaEnabled }`
- `GET ${RUNTIME_CONFIG_ENDPOINT}`:
  - response: `{ appName, apiBaseUrl?, defaultLocale, supportedLocales[], sentryDsn?, featureFlagsBootstrap? }`

### M0 readiness checks

- [ ] login/refresh/logout documented and testable
- [ ] `${ME_ENDPOINT}` returns real permissions (or stable equivalent shape)
- [ ] `problem+json` and `X-Schema-Version` in place
- [ ] sample fixtures available for FE/MSW

